t-size:6.5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;position:relative;top:-3.5pt;vertical-align:baseline">5,14</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"> Results for the quarter were driven by a broad-based increase in levels of client activity. </font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:10pt">Net interest income increased from a year ago primarily driven by the cumulative impact of lending growth.  </font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#005b94;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Provision for credit losses&#58;</font></div><div style="padding-left:25.75pt;text-indent:5.75pt"><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:10pt">Provision for credit losses increased from a year ago driven by higher assessments for specific loans.</font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#005b94;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Total Expenses&#58;</font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:13.5pt;text-indent:-13.5pt"><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height