ckground-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.75pt">The Board of Directors reauthorized a multi-year common equity share repurchase program of up to $20 billion, without a set expiration date, beginning in the third quarter of 2025.</font></div><div style="text-indent:5.75pt"><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:12.25pt;text-indent:-12.25pt"><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.75pt">The Board of Directors declared a $1.00 quarterly dividend per share, an increase of 7.5 cents, payable on August&#160;15, 2025 to common shareholders of record on July&#160;31, 2025.</font></div><div><font><br></font></div><div style="padding-left:12.25pt;text-indent:-12.25pt"><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8226;</font><font style="background-color:#ffffff;color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.75pt">The effective tax rate for the current quarter was 22.7%. </font></div><div style="text-indent:5.75pt"><font><br></font></div></div><div style="display:inline-block;max-width:0.000%;min-width:0.000%;vertical-align:top"></div><div style="display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:43.411%"><div style="margin-bottom:0.12pt;padding-left:4.5pt"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:74.949%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:2.628%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="width:50.086%"></td><td style="width:0.1%"></td><td style="width:1.0%"></td><td style="widt